usage: saved_rng_endpoint_inventory_a01.py [-h] --before-melted BEFORE_MELTED
                                           --after-melted AFTER_MELTED
                                           --before-raw BEFORE_RAW
                                           --after-raw AFTER_RAW
                                           --decoder-before-receipt DECODER_BEFORE_RECEIPT
                                           --decoder-after-receipt DECODER_AFTER_RECEIPT
                                           --output OUTPUT

Read existing Rakaly text endpoints; no native calls or RNG evaluation.
Inventories saved keys with RNG-like names, rather than claiming these contain
all engine or execution-context RNG. Repeated event ordinals are locations
only.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --before-melted BEFORE_MELTED
  --after-melted AFTER_MELTED
  --before-raw BEFORE_RAW
  --after-raw AFTER_RAW
  --decoder-before-receipt DECODER_BEFORE_RECEIPT
  --decoder-after-receipt DECODER_AFTER_RECEIPT
  --output OUTPUT
